Organizer --> UC27
Organizer --> UC28

' Héritage simplifié
Organizer --|> User : hérite des droits utilisateur

' Relations d'inclusion
UC1 ..> UC7 : include
UC2 ..> UC8 : include
UC3 ..> UC9 : include
UC12 ..> UC13 : include
UC12 ..> UC17 : include
UC19 ..> UC20 : include
UC22 ..> UC23 : include

' Relations d'extension
UC11 ..> UC8 : extend
UC15 ..> UC14 : extend
UC26 ..> UC25 : extend

note right of UC19
  Validation en temps réel
  via QR code
end note

note right of UC13
  Analytics avancées :
  - Ventes par période
  - Conversion
  - Revenus
end note

note right of UC22
  Notifications :
  - Email
  - Push
  - SMS
end note

@enduml